'''''Lessertia''''' is a [[genus]] of [[flowering plant]]s in the [[legume]] family, [[Fabaceae]]. It  contains some 62 species native to eastern and southern Africa.<ref name = powo/> It belongs to [[Family (taxonomy)|subfamily]] [[Faboideae]].<ref name=Manning>{{cite book | last = Manning | first = John | title = Field Guide to Fynbos | publisher = Struik Publishers | location = Cape Town | year = 2008 | isbn = 978-1-77007-265-7 }}</ref>

